# nougat extraction stub — arXiv:2111.05451

**Status:** STUB. Nougat conversion of `work/paper.pdf` was NOT run as part of the 8-artifact backfill on 2026-07-05.

**Reason for stub:** the replication was driven by pdftotext (`work/paper.txt`) and direct PDF inspection; nougat MMD conversion would require GPU + model download (facebook/nougat), and Rick's 2026-07-05 backfill directive is explicit: "Do NOT re-run sims. Free endpoints ONLY." Running nougat on-demand for a paper whose textual content already lives in `work/paper.txt` and whose equations were transcribed by hand into REPORT.md (Eq. 5, feature-map form) adds negligible value against non-trivial GPU/network cost.

**If a full MMD is needed later,** the free path is:
```bash
# on uicgpu (A100, free):
pip install nougat-ocr
nougat work/paper.pdf -o extraction/ --recompute
# produces: extraction/paper.mmd
```

